  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance to support the Ministry of Trade and Industry to enhance regional economic and trade integration of Rwanda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;To strengthen capacity of the AfCFTA team at MINICOM for the implementation of trade agreements: 1) provide technical support to the AfCFTA team in implementing goods and services liberalisation, as well as investment, competition and intellectual property rights; 2) Strengthen the institutional framework of the AfCFTA team with capacity building; 3) Conduct export sector assessment and market intelligence; 4) Support the analytical work towards the implementation of Private Sector Development and Youth Employment Strategy in line with the AfCFTA agreement.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
